# Machine overlay for the second machine (tecnalia) — a laptop with up to
# three outputs (built-in + two external), or just the built-in when undocked.
# Enable it by uncommenting `include tecnalia` in the main config, then set
# the values for that machine. The desk scripts skip disconnected outputs
# automatically. Define the output letters contiguously (a, b, c, ...).

# set $desks 9
# set $a eDP-1
# set $b HDMI-A-1
# set $c DP-1
#
# output $a {
#     resolution 1920x1080@60Hz
#     position 0,0
# }
#
# output $b {
#     resolution 1920x1080@60Hz
#     position 1920,0
# }
#
# output $c {
#     resolution 1920x1080@60Hz
#     position 3840,0
# }
